<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian companies ex-div to June 6.</title>
<headline>Australian companies ex-div to June 6.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of companies going ex-dividend to June 6, compiled from information supplied by the Australian Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Friday, May 30</p>
<p>    Islands Hotels		     2.49 cents</p>
<p>    Pacific Dunlop			7.0 cents</p>
<p>Monday, June 2</p>
