<p>Tuesday, June 3</p>
<p>    Westpac Banking Corporation    19.0 cents</p>
<p>Wednesday, June 4</p>
<p>    Bank of Queensland		 65.0 cents</p>
<p>    Public Holdings		     5.0 cents</p>
<p>    St George Bank		     26.0 cents</p>
<p>Thursday, June 5</p>
<p>Westpac Banking Corporation 24.38 cents  </p>
<p>Friday, June 6</p>
<p>    Australian Chemical Holdings    9.0 cents</p>
